A [[Sentience|sentient]] '''species''' existed in [[the galaxy]]. The [[Force-sensitive]] being [[Maz Kanata]]<ref name="DB">{{Databank|maz-kanata|Maz Kanata}}</ref> and an [[assassin]] were both members of the [[species]].<ref name="JangoFett1">[[Jango Fett 1|''Jango Fett'' 1]]</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
In the reference book ''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]'' released in [[2019]], Maz Kanata's species is stated as unknown.<ref name="TROS VD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> However, in the [[Wikipedia:Japanese language|Japanese]] version of the same book, it is identified as "ギルブロジアン".<ref name="TROS VD Jp">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]'' {{C|[[Wikipedia:Japanese language|Japanese]] version}}</ref>

